OL,3,ATime to focus on cost of living, says
OL,4,APM after US election results
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe said he couldn't ease cost of living
OL,7,Fpressures until the US's conflict in
OL,8,FIran had been resolved.
OL,10,FResponding to the midterm results, the
OL,11,FUS president acknowledged that rising
OL,12,Ffuel prices - caused by the Iran war -
OL,13,Fhad played a part in his party's
OL,14,Fdefeats.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/39
